1
00:04:24,545 --> 00:04:30,545
He's going to need a vacation after this vacation.

2
00:08:49,090 --> 00:08:55,090
Hotel Transylvania 3: Summer Vacation is a animation, comedy,
family film directed by Genndy Tartakovsky.

3
00:13:13,636 --> 00:13:19,636
Dracula, Mavis, Johnny and the rest of the Drac Pack take a vacation on a luxury Monster Cruise Ship, where Dracula falls in love
with the ship’s captain, Ericka, who’s secretly a descendant of Abraham Van Helsing, the notorious monster slayer.

4
00:17:38,181 --> 00:17:44,181
Count Dracula (voice), played by Adam Sandler.

5
00:22:02,727 --> 00:22:08,727
Johnny Loughran (voice), played by Andy Samberg.

6
00:26:27,272 --> 00:26:33,272
Mavis Dracula (voice), played by Selena Gomez.

7
00:30:51,818 --> 00:30:57,818
Ericka Van Helsing (voice), played by Kathryn Hahn.

8
00:35:16,363 --> 00:35:22,363
Professor Abraham Van Helsing (voice), played by Jim Gaffigan.

9
00:39:40,909 --> 00:39:46,909
Frankenstein (voice), played by Kevin James.

10
00:44:05,454 --> 00:44:11,454
Hotel Transylvania 3: Summer Vacation (released internationally as Hotel Transylvania 3: A Monster Vacation) is a 2018 American
animated monster comedy film directed by Genndy Tartakovsky and written by Tartakovsky and Michael McCullers.

11
00:48:30,000 --> 00:48:36,000
Produced by Sony Pictures Animation, it is the third
film in the Hotel Transylvania franchise.

12
00:52:54,545 --> 00:53:00,545
Adam Sandler, Andy Samberg, Selena Gomez, Kevin James, David Spade, Steve Buscemi, Keegan-Michael Key, Molly Shannon, Fran Drescher,
and Mel Brooks reprise their roles from previous installments, with Kathryn Hahn and Jim Gaffigan joining the cast.

13
00:57:19,090 --> 00:57:25,090
In the film, Dracula finds love with a ship captain named Ericka while on a vacation on a luxury cruise liner with his family and
friends, but it is revealed that she is actually the great-granddaughter of his arch-nemesis, Abraham Van Helsing.

14
01:01:43,636 --> 01:01:49,636
The film was announced in November 2015.

15
01:06:08,181 --> 01:06:14,181
Tartakovsky confirmed his return in June 2016 after receiving inspiration from a
"miserable" family vacation and the Chevy Chase National Lampoon's Vacation movies.

16
01:10:32,727 --> 01:10:38,727
The title was revealed in November 2017.

17
01:14:57,272 --> 01:15:03,272
Hotel Transylvania 3: Summer Vacation premiered at the Annecy International Animation Film Festival
on June 13, 2018, and was theatrically released in the United States on July 13.

18
01:19:21,818 --> 01:19:27,818
The film received mixed reviews from critics and grossed $528 million against a budget
of $65–80 million, making it the highest-grossing film in the series.

19
01:23:46,363 --> 01:23:52,363
A further sequel, Hotel Transylvania: Transformania, was released in 2022, while a spin-off
series, Motel Transylvania, is scheduled to premiere on Netflix in 2027.

20
01:28:10,909 --> 01:28:16,909
The film explores themes of monster, vampire, vacation, romance, cruise ship.

21
01:32:35,454 --> 01:32:41,454
The tone is lighthearted.
